{
  "_readme": "A stat card over footage: the triptych preset with three numbers, on a plate that drifts slowly under grain. Assets to carry: plate (a picture), grain (a tile). Slots: Label 1, Number 1, Label 2, Number 2, Label 3, Number 3.",
